Subscriptions: receipts and invoices that come every week, month, quarter or year, with the next charge, the yearly cost, price changes and status (active, overdue, ended), and totals per currency. `--format json` for scripts and agents

Usage: mxr records subscriptions [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
